Kircheis:

00:22:50.850 --> 00:22:55.550
Hironaka Masashi

00:22:51.370 --> 00:23:07.650
Even when I feel empty and want to throw away my life, to die...

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.560
Basel:

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.560
Nakata Kouji

00:23:08.590 --> 00:23:13.160
