Toshiaki

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:30.840
Timing:
Todd Perkins

00:23:28.290 --> 00:23:44.400
Even when I decide that there's no meaning in life, no reason to live...

00:23:30.840 --> 00:23:36.850
Song Translation:
Toshiaki

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:43.050
