Subtitled by:
Central Anime(Kansas)

00:23:45.420 --> 00:24:01.770
This body chooses to live - Such a mystery of life

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:20.870
When I call you, you surely don't recall what you've accomplished

00:24:22.250 --> 00:24:40.620
When I call you, you softly smile, and that's all I need

00:24:44.900 --> 00:24:49.600
Preview of Next Episode

00:24:47.280 --> 00:24:50.340
Finally, Kircheis nears the
truth of the whole affair.

00:24:50.340 --> 00:24:56.400
In order to clear Keyserling's
dishonor and to expose Basel's crime...

00:24:56.400 --> 00:24:58.230
...he needed to secure
Johanna's cooperation.

00:24:59.240 --> 00:25:04.220
In his efforts to this end, he faces
an insurmountable obstacle.

00:25:04.950 --> 00:25:15.040
Legend of the Galactic Heroes Gaiden

00:25:04.950 --> 00:25:15.040
Dishonor
Chapter 4

00:25:05.280 --> 00:25:06.750
Next episode of...

00:25:10.280 --> 00:25:13.370
For the lost time, with sorrow.
